{
  "info": {
    "name": "TransferApp API",
    "description": "Multi-tenant SMS-based money transfer platform for Chad.\n\n## Setup Flow\n1. Login as Super Admin (companyCode: __SYSTEM__) \u2014 token auto-saved\n2. Create a company \u2014 companyId auto-saved\n3. Create cities \u2014 cityId/cityId2 auto-saved\n4. Create a company admin \u2014 adminAgentId auto-saved\n5. Login as Company Admin \u2014 token auto-switched\n6. Manage agents, pairings, commissions, etc.\n\n## Auto-saved Variables\nAll tokens and IDs are automatically saved to collection variables after each successful request. No manual copy-paste needed.\n\nVariables: baseUrl, token, companyId, cityId, cityId2, adminAgentId, agentId, agentId2, pairingId, commissionId, transactionId",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "9eb11c39-fcd2-4991-b808-c0392a80eee0"
  },
